WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:06.758
This video shows how to take a library book back on a phone, including a late return with a fine.

00:00:08.424 --> 00:00:16.104
Tap the menu button, open Library and choose Issue / Return. Then tap the Return Book tab.

00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:30.913
Search by the borrower or the book title. Typing Ali shows his loan, Basic Geometry.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:40.093
Tap Process Return. A window shows the book, the borrower and the due date.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:54.210
Tap Confirm Return. A message confirms it, and the loan leaves the list because the copy is back on the shelf.

00:00:56.008 --> 00:01:04.960
Now search for Fatima. Her card shows a fine, and when you tap Process Return the window shows the days overdue and the fine.

00:01:21.585 --> 00:01:29.217
Tap Confirm Return. The fine is worked out for you, and a message shows it as the return is recorded.

00:01:31.706 --> 00:01:36.842
Both books are back on the shelf, and the fine for the late one was worked out for you.
